                        Architecture                                            
                                                                                
                        A Program owns the terminal and one event loop. Messages
                        go in, a View comes out, and the renderer writes only   
                        what changed. See quick start (#quick-start) again.     
                                                                                
                        Testing                                                 
                                                                                
                        tuitest runs a model headless: send keys, read the      
                        screen, compare a golden file.                          
                                                                                
                                                                                
